-pre "><b class="text-[22px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy">17</b><span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-cp-ink-3"> of 49</span></span><span class="text-[15px] leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink-2">Ran out of time</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="17/49" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track mt-1"><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 34.69387755102041%;"></span></span></li><li data-w="W-IP-NOPLAN" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><span data-num="5" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="inline-flex items-baseline whitespace-pre "><b class="text-[22px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy">5</b><span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-cp-ink-3"> of 49</span></span><span class="text-[15px] leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink-2">Practice never set</span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="5/49" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track mt-1"><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-ink-3" style="width: 10.204081632653061%;"></span></span></li></ul><p data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="pt-3 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">of the same 49 lessons</p><p class="pt-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2"><span data-stat="median" data-base="17" data-win="w4-2026-09-28">In the lessons that ran out of time, the explanation ran a median of about 6 minutes over the plan.</span> <span data-num="7" data-den="17" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">7 of these also ended before the closing check.</span></p></div></section><section data-testid="w-where" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">Where it shows</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><ul class="flex flex-col"><li data-testid="w-where-row" class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-cp-hairline py-3.5 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink first:border-t-0 "><span><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-03</span> · <span data-num="6" data-den="9" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">6 of 9</span> lessons · visit <span data-date="2026-10-28">Wed 28 Oct</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="6/9" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track "><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 66.66666666666666%;"></span></span></li><li data-testid="w-where-row" class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-cp-hairline py-3.5 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink first:border-t-0 "><span><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-05</span> · <span data-num="5" data-den="11" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">5 of 11</span> lessons · visit <span data-date="2026-11-03">Tue 3 Nov</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="5/11" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track "><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 45.45454545454545%;"></span></span></li><li data-testid="w-where-row" class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-cp-hairline py-3.5 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink first:border-t-0 "><span><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-02</span> · <span data-num="2" data-den="8" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">2 of 8</span> lessons · visit <span data-date="2026-11-05">Thu 5 Nov</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="2/8" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track "><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 25%;"></span></span></li></ul><a data-testid="w-where-all" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center text-[15px] font-semibold text-cp-green-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME/where">All schools ›</a></div></section></div><section data-testid="w-good" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">What good looks like</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">The teacher reads the plan's task aloud in one sentence, says how many items and where, and says the time. A child is timekeeper. The room drops to a murmur. The teacher moves along the aisle and says one specific line to five children, one per row, in under 30 seconds each. A signal ends it with at least three minutes left for the closure check.</p></div></section><details data-testid="w-method" class="group mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-3"><summary class="flex min-h-[44px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-semibold text-cp-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">How this was counted</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-cp-ink-3 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pb-1 pt-2"><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Scored by lesson-plan fidelity (<span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">google/gemini-3.8-flash</span>)</p><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Window 28 Sep to 25 Oct, 4 weeks; rolls every Monday</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Counted: lessons whose plan asked for this step. Not counted: recordings without a linked plan.</p><p data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Excluded: 2 lesson-mismatch, 1 unusable, 1 duplicates, 0 analysis failed</p><p data-num="53" data-den="62" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Of 62 recordings, 53 had a linked plan</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Every recording counts at the teacher's current school.</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">A recording that stops early can look like a lesson that ran out of time.</p><p class="text-[13px] text-cp-ink-3">Query <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">q-coachip-w-ip-time-v1</span></p></div></details></div><div class="lg:hidden"><p data-testid="trust-line" class="px-1 pt-6 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">Codes, never names. For coaching, never for evaluation.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

