ss="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-02</span> · <span data-num="2" data-den="8" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">2 of 8</span> lessons · visit <span data-date="2026-11-05">Thu 5 Nov</span></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-bar="2/8" class="block h-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cp-track "><span data-fill="" class="block h-full rounded-full bg-cp-green" style="width: 25%;"></span></span></li></ul><a data-testid="w-where-all" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center text-[15px] font-semibold text-cp-green-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME/where">All schools ›</a></div></section></div><section data-testid="w-good" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">What good looks like</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">The teacher reads the plan's task aloud in one sentence, says how many items and where, and says the time. A child is timekeeper. The room drops to a murmur. The teacher moves along the aisle and says one specific line to five children, one per row, in under 30 seconds each. A signal ends it with at least three minutes left for the closure check.</p></div></section><details data-testid="w-method" class="group mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-3"><summary class="flex min-h-[44px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-semibold text-cp-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">How this was counted</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" 