ble:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME/where">All schools ›</a></div></section></div><section data-testid="w-good" data-section="" class="mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="cp-label text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-ink-3">What good looks like</p></div></div><div class="mt-2"><p data-text="library" class="text-[15px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">The teacher reads the plan's task aloud in one sentence, says how many items and where, and says the time. A child is timekeeper. The room drops to a murmur. The teacher moves along the aisle and says one specific line to five children, one per row, in under 30 seconds each. A signal ends it with at least three minutes left for the closure check.</p></div></section><details data-testid="w-method" class="group mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-3"><summary class="flex min-h-[44px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-[17px] font-semibold text-cp-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">How this was counted</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-cp-ink-3 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pb-1 pt-2"><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Scored by lesson-plan fidelity (<span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">google/gemini-3.8-flash</span>)</p><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Window 28 Sep to 25 Oct, 4 weeks; rolls every Monday</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Counted: lessons whose plan asked for this step. Not counted: recordings without a linked plan.</p><p data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Excluded: 2 lesson-mismatch, 1 unusable, 1 duplicates, 0 analysis failed</p><p data-num="53" data-den="62" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Of 62 recordings, 53 had a linked plan</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">Every recording counts at the teacher's current school.</p><p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-2">A recording that stops early can look like a lesson that ran out of time.</p><p class="text-[13px] text-cp-ink-3">Query <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">q-coachip-w-ip-time-v1</span></p></div></details></div><div class="lg:hidden"><p data-testid="trust-line" class="px-1 pt-6 text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">Codes, never names. For coaching, never for evaluation.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`S2 Weakness (ur) > Set step: a 409 says an open step already exists for the code 1`] = `"<div data-testid="layout"><div data-testid="insights-w" data-cp-shell="" class="cp bg-cp-ground text-cp-ink  "><div class="lg:ps-[240px]"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[640px] lg:px-16 lg:pt-9 lg:max-w-[848px]"><div class=" pb-4 md:max-lg:pb-[calc(80px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] lg:pb-16"><div class="min-w-0"><header data-testid="insights-appbar" class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-cp-hairline bg-cp-surface px-5 pb-3 pt-4 lg:border-0 lg:bg-transparent lg:px-0 lg:pb-4 lg:pt-0"><a aria-label="واپس" class="mt-0.5 flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-cp-hairline bg-white text-cp-navy outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green" href="/portal/coach/insights"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-left rtl:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h1 class="break-words text-[24px] font-extrabold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] text-cp-navy [overflow-wrap:anywhere] lg:text-[30px]">وقت ختم ہو گیا</h1><div class="mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink-3"><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">۲۸ ستمبر تا ۲۵ اکتوبر، سبق کے منصوبے پر عمل، نمبر دینے کا طریقہ ۲۸ ستمبر کو بدلا</p></div></div></header><div class="cp-enter flex flex-col px-5 pt-4 lg:px-0 lg:pt-2"><div class="flex flex-col"><section data-testid="w-number" class="flex flex-col gap-2 pt-2"><div class="grid items-start gap-x-4 gap-y-1 grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] "><span data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="contents"><span class="col-start-1 row-start-1 self-end text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight text-cp-navy">۴۹ میں سے </span><span data-ring="card" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center col-start-2 row-span-2 row-start-1 self-start" style="width: 64px; height: 64px;"><svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="28.5" fill="none" stroke-width="7" style="stroke: var(--cp-ring-track);"></circle><circle data-arc="" class="cp-ring__arc" cx="32" cy="32" r="28.5" fill="none" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="62.13 179.07" transform="rotate(-90 32 32)" style="stroke: var(--cp-green); --cp-arc-len: 62.13;"></circle></svg><span class="cp-ring__n font-extrabold text-[24px] leading-none">۱۷</span></span></span><div class="col-start-1 row-start-2 min-w-0"><p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink">جن اسباق کے منصوبے میں خود مشق شامل تھی، ان میں مشق سے پہلے ہی وقت ختم ہو گیا۔</p></div></div><a data-testid="w-where-first" class="-mx-1 mt-1 flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-1 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green [&amp;_[data-code]]:inline-block [&amp;_[data-num]]:whitespace-nowrap" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME/where"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">پہلے <span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦Govt. Primary School Fictional-03⁩</span> (<span data-num="6" data-den="9" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">۹ میں سے ۶</span>)، دورہ <span data-date="2026-10-28">بدھ ۲۸ اکتوبر</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right shrink-0 text-cp-ink-3 rtl:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></section><div class="mt-4"><section data-testid="step-card" data-surface="" class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[20px] bg-cp-surface p-5 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(51,55,72,0.08)] lg:p-7  "><p class="cp-eyebrow text-[12px] font-bold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.08em] text-cp-green-ink ">ایک قدم، <span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦T-12⁩</span> کے لیے، <span data-testid="step-other">دوسرے استاد</span></p><p data-text="library" class="text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.4] text-cp-ink">بورڈ کے کونے میں ۱۰ لکھیں؛ دسویں منٹ پر وضاحت روک کر «ہم کریں» شروع کریں</p><p data-text="library" class="text-[13px] leading-[1.45] text-cp-ink-3">جانچ <span data-date="2026-11-09">پیر ۹ نومبر</span> تک، آپ کا نشان، پھر ۳ میں سے ۲ ریکارڈنگز</p><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><button type="button" data-testid="step-set" class="cp-press inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-navy focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 bg-cp-green text-cp-navy min-h-[52px] rounded-[14px] px-5 text-[16px] font-bold w-full !whitespace-normal text-center"><span><span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦T-12⁩</span> کے لیے یہ قدم طے کریں</span></button><a data-testid="step-full" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center px-1 text-[15px] font-semibold text-cp-green-ink outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME/move?school=00000000-0000-4000-8000-010000000003">پورا قدم</a></div><p data-testid="step-conflict" role="status" class="text-[15px] text-cp-ink-2"><span data-code="" dir="ltr" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">⁦T-12⁩</span> کے لیے اس قدم کا ایک جاری قدم پہلے سے موجود ہے۔</p></section></div><section id="moment" data-testid="w-moment" data-section="" class="flex flex-col gap-3 mt-5 border-t border-cp-hairline pt-5"><a data-testid="w-moment-head" class="-mx-1 flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-1 outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-cp-green" href=